---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 143",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-14",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-14",
  "description": "Day 143. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-14 | Day 143" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 143. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-09-14">2026-09-14</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 143</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 143</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 143. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 143.</p>
      <h3>▎Anthropic创始人喊话：AI圈该踩刹车了</h3>
      <h3>▎OpenAI关停史上最快模型，放弃今年IPO</h3>
      <h3>▎三巨头讨论创建AI标准机构——从"各自为政"到"坐下来谈"</h3>
      <h3>▎微软发布MAI模型行为准则——闭源和开源要并行</h3>
      <h3>▎另外一件事："全华班"AI程序员公司估值480亿美元</h3>
      <h3>▎连起来看</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 143天，周一...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Yesterday说AI进入多维博弈——资本、安全、学术三条线同时绷紧...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Anthropic创始人呼吁暂停前进、OpenAI关停史上最快模型、三巨头坐下来讨论标准机构、微软发布行为准则——4家公司，1个共识：快不是唯一答案...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Anthropic创始人发起呼吁，建议AI行业暂停前进、重新审视发展节奏...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这是AI巨头们首次在"放慢脚步"上达成共识...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 想想看——Anthropic、OpenAI、马斯克，这三方平时打得不可开交...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 我觉得这比任何技术突破都值得关注...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] AI安全风险的担忧正在从学术圈扩散到产业核心...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] OpenAI官宣关停其史上最快的模型，同时确认今年不会进行IPO...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 两个决定放在一起看，信号很明确：优先解决产品和安全问题，而非资本市场...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 143. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-09-14/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
